{"id":1931,"date":"2026-08-25T18:24:12","date_gmt":"2026-08-25T18:24:12","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1931"},"modified":"2026-08-25T19:02:16","modified_gmt":"2026-08-25T19:02:16","slug":"the-page-parts-library","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/accessibility\/the-page-parts-library\/","title":{"rendered":"The Page Parts Library"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Page Parts Library<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1947\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ThePagePartsLibrary.webp\" alt=\"The Page Parts Library\" width=\"128\" height=\"119\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ThePagePartsLibrary.webp 920w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ThePagePartsLibrary-300x279.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/ThePagePartsLibrary-768x714.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Page Parts library provides 20 professional, drag-and-drop structural building blocks that automatically inherit your document&#8217;s current colour scheme and fonts. Rather than building common layout components from scratch, you can insert a ready-made, on-brand block and simply fill it with your content.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Opening the Page Parts Library<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1944\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OpeningThePagePartsLibrary.webp\" alt=\"Opening the Page Parts Library\" width=\"128\" height=\"132\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OpeningThePagePartsLibrary.webp 433w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/OpeningThePagePartsLibrary-292x300.webp 292w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Go to <strong>Insert &gt; Page Parts<\/strong>. The library opens and displays all available components.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Available Page Parts<\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1941\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AvailablePagePartsExamples-1-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"Examples of used page parts\" width=\"286\" height=\"627\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AvailablePagePartsExamples-1-scaled.jpg 1168w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AvailablePagePartsExamples-1-137x300.jpg 137w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AvailablePagePartsExamples-1-467x1024.jpg 467w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AvailablePagePartsExamples-1-768x1683.jpg 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AvailablePagePartsExamples-1-701x1536.jpg 701w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/AvailablePagePartsExamples-1-934x2048.jpg 934w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 286px) 100vw, 286px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Info Callout &#8211;<\/strong> Tinted box with a thick left-hand colour accent, ideal for tips or warnings.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Contact Block &#8211;<\/strong> Wide footer block with Phone, Email, and Website placeholders.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Numbered Steps (Left &amp; Right) &#8211;<\/strong> Bold circular numbered graphic, alternatable for zig-zag step layouts.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Tear-off Coupon &#8211;<\/strong> Classic dashed-border box for special offers.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Author Bio &#8211;<\/strong> Horizontal profile block for an avatar, credentials, and background text.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Checklist Item &#8211;<\/strong> Text item with a green circle and checkmark.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Menu Item &#8211;<\/strong> Restaurant menu item with a title, price, and dotted leader line.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Photo Block &#8211;<\/strong> Grey image placeholder with a caption slot.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Review Quote &#8211;<\/strong> Customer testimonial block with 5 golden stars.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Event Date &#8211;<\/strong> Calendar badge (Month + Day) alongside a headline and description.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Stat Callout &#8211;<\/strong> Oversized bolded number layout for highlighting key statistics.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Signature Line &#8211;<\/strong> Classic dotted \u201cSign Here\u201d block.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Pros &amp; Cons &#8211;<\/strong> Two-column list with a green Pros section and a red Cons section.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Q&amp;A Block &#8211;<\/strong> Question and Answer pair with bold coloured Q\/A markers.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Key Takeaway &#8211;<\/strong> Tinted summary box for highlighting the most important point in a document.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Warning Alert &#8211;<\/strong> Bright orange caution box for critical steps or potential dangers.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1934 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PagePartsExamples.webp\" alt=\"Available Page Parts\" width=\"1613\" height=\"654\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PagePartsExamples.webp 1613w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PagePartsExamples-300x122.webp 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PagePartsExamples-1024x415.webp 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PagePartsExamples-768x311.webp 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/PagePartsExamples-1536x623.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1613px) 100vw, 1613px\" \/><\/h2>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Page Parts Library The Page Parts library provides 20 professional, drag-and-drop structural building blocks that automatically inherit your document&#8217;s current colour scheme and fonts. Rather than building common layout components from scratch, you can insert a ready-made, on-brand block and simply fill it with your content. Opening the Page Parts Library Go to Insert [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1947,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[23],"class_list":["post-1931","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-accessibility"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1931","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1931"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1931\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1950,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1931\/revisions\/1950"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1947"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1931"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1931"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}